  701  .PARAM WE      = 'WM/NFING+XW-2*WINT-2*(0/(LM^1)+0/((WM/NFING)^1)+0/((WM/NFING)^1)/(LM^1))'
  702  .PARAM LE      = 'LM+XL-2.0*LINT-2.0*(0/(LM^1)+0/((WM/NFING)^1)+0/((WM/NFING)^1)/(LM^1))'
  703  * AC Effective length and width:
  704  *------------------------------
