  706  .PARAM LEC     = 'LM+XL-2.0*DLC-2.0*(-2.4972E-16/(LM^1)+0/((WM/NFING)^1)+0/((WM/NFING)^1)/(LM^1))'
  707  *  Effective Source/Drain Junction width:
