 2346  *       0       yes    no     no             no
 2347  *       1       no     yes    no             no
 2348  *       2       no     no     yes            no
 2349  *       3       no     no     no             yes
 2350  *
 2351  .PARAM MFLAG_NO        = 'VALIF((SVTLP_DEV==0),(1),(0))'
