  493  *--------------------------------------------------------
  494  * sramsphvtlp_dev  no_mm  mc_mm  mm_in_corners  param_mm
  495  *       0       yes    no     no             no
  496  *       1       no     yes    no             no
  497  *       2       no     no     yes            no
  498  *       3       no     no     no             yes
  499  *
