   20  *    1       yes        yes       no             C
   21  *    2       yes        no        yes            R
   22  *    3       yes        no        no             RC
   23  *
   24  .PARAM LPER = 'VALIF(((LPE==2) || (LPE==3)),(1),(0))'
   25  .PARAM LPEC = 'VALIF(((LPE==1) || (LPE==3) || (LPE==97)),(1),(0))'
